    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ten new letters",
     "texto": [
      "These do not look like the letters you know, so they will not fool you: you just have to learn them.",
      "**Б** is **b**. **Г** sounds like the **g** in «go»; before **е** and **и**, the consonant softens. **Д** is **d**. **З** is a **voiced z**, with a buzz, like the «s» in «rose». **Л** is **l**. **П** is **p**. **Ф** is **f**.",
      "**И** is **ee**. **Й** is a **short i**, like the «y» in «boy». **Э** is an open **e**, like the e in «bed»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
