    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the end they lose their voice.",
     "texto": [
      "At the end of a word, voiced consonants lose their voice: **б** sounds «p», **г** sounds «k», **д** sounds «t» and **з** sounds «s».",
      "That is why **друг** (friend) is said «druk» and **город** (city) «GOH-rut»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "This is…",
     "texto": [
      "In these introductions, **это** means «this is», «this one is» or «this is», and it stays the same: **Это дом** (this is a house), **это мама** (this is Mum).",
      "To ask where: **Где?** **Где банк?** = where is the bank?",
      "**И** = and. **Или** = or."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
